          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can I arrange plumbing and electrical work through one enquiry?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Tell us which rooms, fittings or equipment are affected and identify any immediate danger. We confirm the appropriate trade arrangements and quote the agreed tasks; a combined enquiry does not mean every task can be completed in one visit."
          }
        },
