          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do I need to diagnose the fault before calling?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "No. Start with the Perth property location and what has changed. Photos are optional, and you should not enter a hazard or dismantle equipment to gather details."
